        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "0805fd63-7a38-369c-ba12-786e51827aae",
                "word": "integendeel",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                        "entry_id": "0805fd63-7a38-369c-ba12-786e51827aae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "luidt een verrassende tegenstelling in"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4190115-949f-4de4-8b34-b84738100e12",
                                "sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                                "text": "Hij is niet ontslagen. Integendeel, hij heeft zelfs promotie gekregen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "098518f3-180d-480e-b203-7944b3b98e33",
                                "sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                                "text": "Ik dacht eerst dat ik tijdens dit experiment niet veel plezier zou hebben en misschien zelfs door de hikers zou worden genegeerd. Maar integendeel, ik heb in jaren niet zoveel gelachen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7ae0112-b44b-44ff-99e1-851cced0e15b",
                                "sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                                "text": "De mensen thuis hadden het Duitse expeditieleger niet zoals de Denen met open armen ontvangen. Integendeel."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b66e39b-b6eb-41b0-b325-5194cb478b3d",
                        "source_entry_id": "0805fd63-7a38-369c-ba12-786e51827aae",
                        "source_sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "zum Gegenteil",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "688e8f71-9958-484e-a1b6-0c84ed31cb3a",
                        "source_entry_id": "0805fd63-7a38-369c-ba12-786e51827aae",
                        "source_sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "on the contrary",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "on the contrary",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c383cb58-8493-3f4d-8637-25e53f3c8efc",
                                        "entry_id": "af3bec45-b60f-33d9-ade3-3c15292073fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Opposite of what had earlier been expected or assumed; to the contrary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b206170b-ec83-4b33-b911-2b7798422938",
                                                "sense_id": "c383cb58-8493-3f4d-8637-25e53f3c8efc",
                                                "text": "Even if they managed to strike Japan, the United States or South Korea with nuclear weapons — a big if, given that they do not have a reliable delivery system — they could not save themselves from ultimate defeat. On the contrary, the use of nuclear or other terror weapons would be certain to invite overwhelming retaliation, delivering North Korea’s decision makers to a fiery oblivion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1afb68ad-f1e9-4835-922d-8266f7b3ce91",
                        "source_entry_id": "0805fd63-7a38-369c-ba12-786e51827aae",
                        "source_sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "otherwise",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "otherwise",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                        "entry_id": "a3666cbf-8f9d-3afe-8c6f-5507dbb19c7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Differently, in another way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95028f6b-1e1a-4921-b91f-6c69e824f55f",
                                                "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                                "text": "You may have a point, but I think otherwise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0f26a5f-78fd-4bda-b7a1-6a12c18b0429",
                                                "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                                "text": "Could I do otherwise than smile?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dd3de1b-af64-4d40-ac25-e8f17539b00f",
                                                "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                                "text": "It is not permitted to sell or otherwise distribute any copies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45f1acf5-2df2-47f9-892c-c6d7be2d2412",
                                                "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                                "text": "There was one rotten apple in an otherwise perfect batch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dba04c1-ec23-49c5-86b0-7d57e030cae6",
                                                "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                                "text": "If any man teach otherwise, and consent not to wholesome words, euen the wordes of our Lord Iesus Christ, and to the doctrine which is according to godlinesse:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afa91719-5de3-4e51-a72c-db5e68e84a40",
                                                "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                                "text": "Much as I wish that I had not to write this chapter, I know that I shall have to swallow many such bitter draughts in the course of this narrative. And I cannot do otherwise, if I claim to be a worshipper of Truth. […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54573fcb-6cd5-464a-a511-0b544d47af88",
                                                "sense_id": "7c02e47f-a680-370b-8bd2-02b238efa37b",
                                                "text": "Fabio Capello insisted Rooney was in the right frame of mind to play in stormy Podgorica despite his father's arrest on Thursday in a probe into alleged betting irregularities, but his flash of temper - when he kicked out at Miodrag Dzudovic - suggested otherwise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b62cb072-5602-3c89-a6bb-5ed48294a86d",
                                        "entry_id": "a3666cbf-8f9d-3afe-8c6f-5507dbb19c7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In different circumstances; or else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "397cb104-70b7-4d34-bfa1-1869ce798590",
                                                "sense_id": "b62cb072-5602-3c89-a6bb-5ed48294a86d",
                                                "text": "I’m not well today, otherwise I would have helped."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2adab10f-626f-4051-87ca-caaa7f719fb4",
                                                "sense_id": "b62cb072-5602-3c89-a6bb-5ed48294a86d",
                                                "text": "You have to open your umbrella, otherwise you'll get wet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f6c1327-2874-43ec-8167-12b603497d37",
                                                "sense_id": "b62cb072-5602-3c89-a6bb-5ed48294a86d",
                                                "text": "They burned the old gun that used to stand in the dark corner up in the garret, close to the stuffed fox that always grinned so fiercely. Perhaps the reason why he seemed in such a ghastly rage was that he did not come by his death fairly. Otherwise his pelt would not have been so perfect. And why else was he put away up there out of sight?—and so magnificent a brush as he had too."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8ee4674-34d2-427a-87e3-548f39180e20",
                                                "sense_id": "b62cb072-5602-3c89-a6bb-5ed48294a86d",
                                                "text": "No matter how early I came down, I would find him on the veranda, smoking cigarettes, or otherwise his man would be there with a message to say that his master would shortly join me if I would kindly wait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3c842df-08ff-4ccc-8a50-08633fa6b668",
                                                "sense_id": "b62cb072-5602-3c89-a6bb-5ed48294a86d",
                                                "text": "Creating a complete map of the human connectome would therefore be a monumental milestone but not the end of the journey to understanding how our brains work. The achievement will transform neuroscience and serve as the starting point for asking questions we could not otherwise have answered,[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "189f398f-6c85-3486-b669-8b94cba6cf50",
                                        "entry_id": "a3666cbf-8f9d-3afe-8c6f-5507dbb19c7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In all other respects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "679fc1ca-6cc3-491a-9622-ca10bded0b4f",
                                                "sense_id": "189f398f-6c85-3486-b669-8b94cba6cf50",
                                                "text": "Looking back at more than four years spent going to college I can now positively say that the most meaninful thing I accomplished (the only meaningful thing I accomplished!) was establishing a gay liberation group on campus. Otherwise my college education was almost useless."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ee5ff3a-f318-4581-8807-e3bcd1e21467",
                                                "sense_id": "189f398f-6c85-3486-b669-8b94cba6cf50",
                                                "text": "He lost his temper once in a while. Otherwise he behaved rationally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56d7259b-0c50-40ab-9638-bdc0535b3a7b",
                                                "sense_id": "189f398f-6c85-3486-b669-8b94cba6cf50",
                                                "text": "Robin van Persie squandered United's best chance late on but otherwise it was a relatively comfortable afternoon for Liverpool's new goalkeeper Simon Mignolet, who has yet to concede a Premier League goal since his £9m summer move from Sunderland."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "otherwise",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24a8db84-800c-3f5e-944a-21f8a5b9ac53",
                                        "entry_id": "96c5c6d1-fe36-3319-8a03-3232a73cda90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Other than supposed; different."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d5f3a7a-33d6-4ea6-8d48-24598e185252",
                                                "sense_id": "24a8db84-800c-3f5e-944a-21f8a5b9ac53",
                                                "text": "He said he didn’t do it, but the evidence was otherwise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d3dea08-1aea-42c3-ab43-238e5d481d8d",
                                                "sense_id": "24a8db84-800c-3f5e-944a-21f8a5b9ac53",
                                                "text": "Statistics need lots of information, digital and otherwise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "41d20230-6c6b-455e-be11-960e8a8a463d",
                        "source_entry_id": "0805fd63-7a38-369c-ba12-786e51827aae",
                        "source_sense_id": "c663113f-5b6a-307f-a68d-e20d26f842a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "au contraire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "au contraire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85701d3e-68e2-3090-ab2b-3619413b76d7",
                                        "entry_id": "277580fc-287b-3d4f-a3df-3da0c366667a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tout autrement ; d’une manière opposée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34bc0e52-b601-446c-ab09-9fb8b76c6a28",
                                                "sense_id": "85701d3e-68e2-3090-ab2b-3619413b76d7",
                                                "text": "Les poils de chèvre diffèrent de la laine du mouton par des cellules de surface externe qui sont un peu moins ou peu saillantes et par des stries de leur substance propre qui, au contraire, sont très apparentes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69cfaceb-4362-4750-a248-65affc840334",
                                                "sense_id": "85701d3e-68e2-3090-ab2b-3619413b76d7",
                                                "text": "Les coups ne m'ont jamais rien fait. Au contraire, je leur dois de m'être créé tout jeune une philosophie qui me permet aujourd'hui d'apprécier de suite et sans arrière-pensée les bons et les mauvais moments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a3cccb7-71e8-4650-82ae-90816d81513d",
                                                "sense_id": "85701d3e-68e2-3090-ab2b-3619413b76d7",
                                                "text": "Dans la Résistance intérieure, les éléments ex-vichyssois, les champions de l’électoralisme, les réactionnaires n'avaient qu'une minime influence. Dans l'appareil « gaulliste », au contraire, les hommes de la droite, et même d'anciens cagoulards, avaient des places éminentes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24d6d8b1-de1c-4c30-8940-d9bc20901be7",
                                                "sense_id": "85701d3e-68e2-3090-ab2b-3619413b76d7",
                                                "text": "Fait curieux, la belle-mère ne renchérit pas. Dans la querelle familiale, elle pencherait au contraire pour la gendresse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "189eb170-ea31-4d63-96f8-e290801a55d1",
                                                "sense_id": "85701d3e-68e2-3090-ab2b-3619413b76d7",
                                                "text": "— Tout le monde croyait que j'allais le flinguer et je savais que personne ne lèverait le petit doigt pour le défendre. Au contraire..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
